/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 58 0 R
/T (Each simulated HEMM is equipped with LiDAR, GPS, IMU, RGB camera and depth sensing. The system combines sensor-based safety assessment, waypoint-based autonomous route following, operator target-speed control, deterministic Vehicle-to-Vehicle \(V2V\) coordination and a centralized real-time control-room dashboard.)
/E (Each simulated HEMM is equipped with LiDAR, GPS, IMU, RGB camera and depth sensing. The system combines sensor-based safety assessment, waypoint-based autonomous route following, operator target-speed control, deterministic Vehicle-to-Vehicle \(V2V\) coordination and a centralized real-time control-room dashboard.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [23]
>>
