116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 58 0 R
/T (The safety layer continuously evaluates obstacle clearance and assigns graduated risk states from CLEAR to CRITICAL. It can reduce the commanded speed or stop a vehicle when a critical hazard is detected. The V2V layer exchanges fleet state through ROS 2 and applies deterministic right-of-way rules at shared conflict zones. A non-priority vehicle can wait with zero motion until the priority vehicle clears the conflict zone.)
/E (The safety layer continuously evaluates obstacle clearance and assigns graduated risk states from CLEAR to CRITICAL. It can reduce the commanded speed or stop a vehicle when a critical hazard is detected. The V2V layer exchanges fleet state through ROS 2 and applies deterministic right-of-way rules at shared conflict zones. A non-priority vehicle can wait with zero motion until the priority vehicle clears the conflict zone.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
