178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 61 0 R
/T (The current V2V layer is deterministic and rule-based rather than an ML model. Vehicles exchange state through ROS 2 fleet topics. At a conflict zone, one vehicle receives right-of-way and another enters a waiting state with zero linear and angular velocity. After the priority vehicle clears the zone, the waiting vehicle is released. Safety remains higher priority than V2V permission.)
/E (The current V2V layer is deterministic and rule-based rather than an ML model. Vehicles exchange state through ROS 2 fleet topics. At a conflict zone, one vehicle receives right-of-way and another enters a waiting state with zero linear and angular velocity. After the priority vehicle clears the zone, the waiting vehicle is released. Safety remains higher priority than V2V permission.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [18]
>>
