272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 65 0 R
/T (The system demonstrates how a fleet of mine vehicles can maintain situational awareness, coordinate at shared conflict points and apply safety-based speed or stop decisions. The simulation-first approach provides a controlled and economical environment for validating safety logic and fleet behavior before moving toward physical implementation. The modular ROS 2 architecture provides a clear path for future integration of industrial sensors, real V2V/V2I communication, higher-precision positioning, AI-based perception and real mine-control systems.)
/E (The system demonstrates how a fleet of mine vehicles can maintain situational awareness, coordinate at shared conflict points and apply safety-based speed or stop decisions. The simulation-first approach provides a controlled and economical environment for validating safety logic and fleet behavior before moving toward physical implementation. The modular ROS 2 architecture provides a clear path for future integration of industrial sensors, real V2V/V2I communication, higher-precision positioning, AI-based perception and real mine-control systems.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [17]
>>
