/Title (The safety layer continuously evaluates obstacle clearance and assigns graduated risk states from CLEAR to CRITICAL. It can reduce the commanded speed or stop a vehicle when a critical hazard is detected. The V2V layer exchanges fleet state through ROS 2 and applies deterministic right-of-way rules at shared conflict zones. A non-priority vehicle can wait with zero motion until the priority vehicle clears the conflict zone.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 341 0 R
/Prev 507 0 R
/Next 388 0 R
>>
